                        Rules: (apply on Operators)
                            a. set priority of operators
                                ( ^, $      high        3
                                  /, *      medium      2
                                  +, -      low         1
                            b.  no two operators of same priority can stay together
                                ...if happens then fork the previous operator and then insert new operator
                            c.  if any operator inside the bracket.. it should be poped out by the bracket
                                ....if (+) then plus will be poped out too use and bracket will be poped out and will not be use
                            d.  lower priority infront of higher priority operator can not be tolerated
                            e. higher priority operator infront of lower priority operator can stay together
